1048
01:12:23,160 --> 01:12:27,560
The checklist on page sixteen can help
before and after a meeting.

1049
01:12:27,560 --> 01:12:30,400
Ask, listen and follow up.

1050
01:12:30,400 --> 01:12:33,520
Before leaving, check who will do what and
when

1051
01:12:33,520 --> 01:12:36,040
you will hear how it is going.

1052
01:12:36,040 --> 01:12:39,350
A conversation becomes more useful when
everyone understands the next

1053
01:12:39,350 --> 01:12:39,680
step.

1054
01:12:42,160 --> 01:12:45,890
The Working Together Communication Tool,
