1062
01:13:07,460 --> 01:13:10,260
A tool gives the conversation a place to
start.

1063
01:13:10,380 --> 01:13:13,220
Keep listening and your child's own
communication alongside it.

1064
01:13:15,400 --> 01:13:19,560
The N C C D Meetings Tool Kit is a free
